# The Canica kit the console installs next. Changing this file on main publishes it:
# .github/workflows/canica-kit.yml checks the download against every value below, proves that
# the published kit upgrades to it, signs its manifest and publishes release
# canica-<firmware slug>. SERIAL only grows: consoles refuse an older one.
